<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="cohort-cybernetica">
      <h2>Cohort Cybernetica</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="cohort-cybernetica-stratagems" data-track="cohort-cybernetica-stratagems"><h3 class="category-title">Stratagems</h3><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-motive-imperative" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}]}" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Motive Imperative</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Cohort Cybernetica – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until your next Command phase, add 3&quot; to Move and add 1 to Advance and Charge rolls for the unit.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-auto-divinatory-targeting" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;LEGIO CYBERNETICA&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}]}" data-target="One LEGIO CYBERNETICA or ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit and one objective marker."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Auto-divinatory Targeting</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Cohort Cybernetica – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One LEGIO CYBERNETICA or ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit and one objective marker.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until your next Command phase, its ranged weapons have BS 3+ and <button class="term-button" data-term="core-ignores-cover" data-term-title="[IGNORES COVER]" data-term-summary="Some weapons are designed to root enemy formations out of entrenched positions. Each time an attack is made with an [IGNORES COVER] weapon, the target cannot have the benefit of cover against that attack Benefit of Cover, including from rules that give a model or unit the…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-18">[IGNORES COVER]</button>, but can only target units within range of the selected objective marker.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-benevolence-of-the-omnissiah" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;LEGIO CYBERNETICA&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}]}" data-target="One LEGIO CYBERNETICA or ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Benevolence of the Omnissiah</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Cohort Cybernetica – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One LEGIO CYBERNETICA or ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until your next Command phase, models have <button class="term-button" data-term="core-feel-no-pain" data-term-title="FEEL NO PAIN" data-term-summary="The hardiest warriors refuse to be laid low, even by wounds that should by all rights prove lethal. This ability always takes the form Feel No Pain X+. Each time a model with this ability would lose a wound, roll one D6: on an X+, that wound is not lost." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-12">Feel No Pain 6+</button>, improved to 5+ against mortal wounds.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-machine-spirit-resurgent" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;LEGIO CYBERNETICA&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;below-starting-strength&quot;]}" data-target="One eligible unit below Starting Strength."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Machine Spirit Resurgent</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Cohort Cybernetica – Epic Deed</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One eligible unit below Starting Strength.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Re-roll Hit rolls until your next Command phase; if Below Half-strength, re-roll Wound rolls as well.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-machine-superiority" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;LEGIO CYBERNETICA&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}]}" data-target="One LEGIO CYBERNETICA or ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Machine Superiority</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Cohort Cybernetica – Epic Deed</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One LEGIO CYBERNETICA or ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>The unit can shoot after Falling Back and ignore modifiers to its characteristics, rolls and tests, excluding saving throws, until end of turn.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-transcendent-cogitation" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;LEGIO CYBERNETICA&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}]}" data-target="One LEGIO CYBERNETICA or ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Transcendent Cogitation</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Cohort Cybernetica – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One LEGIO CYBERNETICA or ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Both Protector and Conqueror Imperatives are active for the unit until your next Command phase.</p></article></section></div>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="cohort-cybernetica-enhancements" data-track="cohort-cybernetica-enhancements"><h3 class="category-title">Enhancements</h3><div class="detachment-grid"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-necromechanic" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Necromechanic"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Necromechanic</h4><p>Once per battle round, when a saving throw made for a friendly Legio Cybernetica or Adeptus Mechanicus Vehicle model within 12&quot; of the bearer is failed, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If they do, change the Damage characteristic of that attack to 0.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-lord-of-machines" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Lord of Machines"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Lord of Machines</h4><p>Once per turn, at the start of your opponent’s Shooting phase, select one enemy Vehicle unit within 12&quot; of and visible to the bearer. That unit must take a Leadership test: if that test is passed, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll; if that test is failed, that unit is not eligible to shoot this phase.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-emotionless-clarity" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Emotionless Clarity"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Emotionless Clarity</h4><p>Once per turn, when a friendly LEGIO CYBERNETICA or ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE model with the Deadly Demise ability that is within 12&quot; of the bearer is destroyed, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If it does, do not roll to determine whether any mortal wounds are inflicted as a result of that model’s Deadly Demise ability. Instead, mortal wounds are automatically inflicted.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-arch-negator" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Arch-negator"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Arch-negator</h4><p>Ranged weapons equipped by the bearer have the <button class="term-button" data-term="core-anti-vehicle" data-term-title="[ANTI]" data-term-summary="Certain weapons are the bane of particular foes. This ability always takes the form [ANTI-X Y+]. Each time an attack is made with an [ANTI] weapon, if the target unit has the keyword denoted by X, an unmodified wound roll of Y+ is a critical wound. Example:…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-03">[ANTI-VEHICLE 4+</button>] ability.</p></article></div></section></div>
    </section>
<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="data-psalm-conclave">
      <h2>Data-psalm Conclave</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="data-psalm-conclave-stratagems" data-track="data-psalm-conclave-stratagems"><h3 class="category-title">Stratagems</h3><article class="stratagem surface turn-any" data-rule-id="stratagem-incantation-of-the-iron-soul" data-turn="ANY TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CULT MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="That CULT MECHANICUS model's unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Incantation of the Iron Soul</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Data-psalm Conclave – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Any phase, after allocating a mortal wound.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>That CULT MECHANICUS model's unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>CULT MECHANICUS models have <button class="term-button" data-term="core-feel-no-pain" data-term-title="FEEL NO PAIN" data-term-summary="The hardiest warriors refuse to be laid low, even by wounds that should by all rights prove lethal. This ability always takes the form Feel No Pain X+. Each time a model with this ability would lose a wound, roll one D6: on an X+, that wound is not lost." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-12">Feel No Pain 4+</button> against mortal wounds for the phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-tribute-of-empathic-veneration" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CULT MECHANICUS&quot;]},{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;enemy&quot;}]}" data-target="One CULT MECHANICUS unit and one enemy unit within 18&quot;."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Tribute of Empathic Veneration</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Data-psalm Conclave – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Start of your Movement phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One CULT MECHANICUS unit and one enemy unit within 18&quot;.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>The enemy takes a Battle-shock test; on failure, subtract 1 from its Hit rolls until your next Command phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-litany-of-the-electromancer" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CULT MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One CULT MECHANICUS unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Litany of the Electromancer</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Data-psalm Conclave – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One CULT MECHANICUS unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Roll for each nearby enemy unit; on a 5+ it suffers D3 mortal wounds, with +1 to the roll for ELECTRO-PRIESTS.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-luminescent-blessing" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CULT MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One CULT MECHANICUS unit selected as a target."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Luminescent Blessing</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Data-psalm Conclave – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent's Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One CULT MECHANICUS unit selected as a target.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>CULT MECHANICUS models in the unit have a 4+ invulnerable save for the phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-any" data-rule-id="stratagem-chant-of-the-remorseless-fist" data-turn="ANY TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CULT MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One CULT MECHANICUS unit that has not fought."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Chant of the Remorseless Fist</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Data-psalm Conclave – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One CULT MECHANICUS unit that has not fought.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Add 1 to Wound rolls for melee attacks made by CULT MECHANICUS models in the unit.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-verse-of-vengeance" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CULT MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One CULT MECHANICUS unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Verse of Vengeance</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Data-psalm Conclave – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One CULT MECHANICUS unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a CULT MECHANICUS model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6: on a 4+, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model's unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.</p></article></section></div>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="data-psalm-conclave-enhancements" data-track="data-psalm-conclave-enhancements"><h3 class="category-title">Enhancements</h3><div class="detachment-grid"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-mechanicus-locum" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Mechanicus Locum"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Mechanicus Locum</h4><p>The bearer has a Leadership characteristic of 6+ and, once per battle, at the start of any phase, you can select one friendly CULT MECHANICUS unit that is Battle-shocked and within 12&quot; of the bearer. That unit is no longer Battle-shocked.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-mantle-of-the-gnosticarch" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Mantle of the Gnosticarch"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Mantle of the Gnosticarch</h4><p>Each time an attack is allocated to the bearer, change the Damage characteristic of that attack to 1.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-data-blessed-autosermon" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Data-blessed Autosermon"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Data-blessed Autosermon</h4><p>Once per battle, at the start of your Command phase, you can select the Benediction of the Omnissiah you did not select at the start of the first battle round. Until the start of your next Command phase, that Benediction of the Omnissiah is active for the bearer’s unit in addition to the one that is currently active for your army.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-temporcopia" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Temporcopia"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Temporcopia</h4><p>The bearer’s unit has the Fights First ability.</p></article></div></section></div>
    </section>
<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="eradication-cohort">
      <h2>Eradication Cohort</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="eradication-cohort-stratagems" data-track="eradication-cohort-stratagems"><h3 class="category-title">Stratagems</h3><article class="stratagem surface turn-any" data-rule-id="stratagem-servo-driven-charge" data-turn="ANY TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Servo-driven Charge</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Eradication Cohort - Wargear Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have <button class="term-button" data-term="core-lance" data-term-title="[LANCE]" data-term-summary="With the momentum of a warrior at full-tilt, lance weapons are deadly on the charge. Each time an attack is made with a [LANCE] weapon, if the attacking model’s unit made a charge move this turn, add 1 to the wound roll." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-21">[LANCE]</button>.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-threat-cogitation-targeters" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SKITARII&quot;,&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}]}" data-target="One SKITARII VEHICLE unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Threat-cogitation Targeters</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Eradication Cohort - Wargear Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One SKITARII VEHICLE unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a ranged attack made by a model in your unit is allocated to a MONSTER or VEHICLE model, you can re-roll the Damage roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-unrelenting-aggression" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="That ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Unrelenting Aggression</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Eradication Cohort - Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase, just after an ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army Falls Back.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>That ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot after Falling Back. If it has the SKITARII keyword, it is eligible to shoot and declare a charge instead.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-precision-onslaught" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SICARIAN&quot;]}]}" data-target="That SICARIAN unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Precision Onslaught</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Eradication Cohort - Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Charge phase, just after a SICARIAN unit from your army declares a charge.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>That SICARIAN unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, after your unit ends a Charge move, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range and roll one D6 for each model in your unit within Engagement Range of it; each 4+ inflicts 1 mortal wound.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-unshackled-wrath" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SKITARII&quot;]}]}" data-target="One SKITARII unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Unshackled Wrath</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Eradication Cohort - Wargear Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One SKITARII unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Select <button class="term-button" data-term="core-sustained-hits" data-term-title="[SUSTAINED HITS]" data-term-summary="Some weapons possess a punishing rate of fire, or can land devastating flurries of blows, tearing the foe apart with relentless ferocity. This ability always takes the form [SUSTAINED HITS X].…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-36">[SUSTAINED HITS</button> 1] or <button class="term-button" data-term="core-lethal-hits" data-term-title="[LETHAL HITS]" data-term-summary="When an attack with LETHAL HITS scores a Critical Hit, it automatically wounds. No Wound roll is made, so that attack cannot score a Critical Wound." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-23">[LETHAL HITS]</button>. Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the selected ability. You can instead select <button class="term-button" data-term="core-sustained-hits" data-term-title="[SUSTAINED HITS]" data-term-summary="Some weapons possess a punishing rate of fire, or can land devastating flurries of blows, tearing the foe apart with relentless ferocity. This ability always takes the form [SUSTAINED HITS X].…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-36">[SUSTAINED HITS</button> 1], <button class="term-button" data-term="core-lethal-hits" data-term-title="[LETHAL HITS]" data-term-summary="When an attack with LETHAL HITS scores a Critical Hit, it automatically wounds. No Wound roll is made, so that attack cannot score a Critical Wound." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-23">[LETHAL HITS]</button> and <button class="term-button" data-term="core-hazardous" data-term-title="[HAZARDOUS]" data-term-summary="Weapons powered by unstable and dangerous energy sources pose a substantial risk to the wielder and those that stand beside them.…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-15">[HAZARDOUS]</button> to apply together.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-analytic-reprisals" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SKITARII&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;lost-models&quot;]}" data-target="One SKITARII INFANTRY unit from your army that lost one or more models to those attacks."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Analytic Reprisals</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Eradication Cohort - Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One SKITARII INFANTRY unit from your army that lost one or more models to those attacks.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but must target only that enemy unit and only if it is an eligible target.</p></article></section></div>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="eradication-cohort-enhancements" data-track="eradication-cohort-enhancements"><h3 class="category-title">Enhancements</h3><div class="detachment-grid"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-omnicogitator" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;units&quot;:[&quot;unit-skitarii-marshal&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Omnicogitator"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Omnicogitator</h4><p>SKITARII MARSHAL model only. The Conqueror Imperative and Protector Imperative are both active for the bearer's unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-martial-signatum-amplificator" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Martial Signatum Amplificator"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Martial Signatum Amplificator</h4><p>TECH-PRIEST model only. Models in the bearer's unit have the SKITARII keyword.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-belicosa-class-capacitor-vanes" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Belicosa-class Capacitor Vanes"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Belicosa-class Capacitor Vanes</h4><p>ADEPTUS MECHANICUS model only. Add 6&quot; to the Range characteristic and 1 to the Strength characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in the bearer's unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-omnissiahs-fury" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;units&quot;:[&quot;unit-skitarii-marshal&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Omnissiah's Fury"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Omnissiah's Fury</h4><p>SKITARII MARSHAL model only. Add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of the bearer's melee weapons, and improve the Armour Penetration and Damage characteristics of those weapons by 1.</p></article></div></section></div>
    </section>
<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="explorator-maniple">
      <h2>Explorator Maniple</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="explorator-maniple-stratagems" data-track="explorator-maniple-stratagems"><h3 class="category-title">Stratagems</h3><article class="stratagem surface turn-any" data-rule-id="stratagem-cached-acquisition" data-turn="ANY TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;destroyed&quot;]}" data-target="That destroyed ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Cached Acquisition</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Explorator Maniple – Epic Deed</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Any phase, just after a unit is destroyed on a controlled objective.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>That destroyed ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>The objective remains under your control until your opponent controls it at the start or end of a turn.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-infoslave-skull" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;]},{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;objective&quot;}]}" data-target="One TECH-PRIEST and another objective within 24&quot;."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Infoslave Skull</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Explorator Maniple – Wargear</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One TECH-PRIEST and another objective within 24&quot;.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>The selected objective is also an Acquisition objective until your next Command phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-any" data-rule-id="stratagem-priority-reclamation" data-turn="ANY TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="That unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Priority Reclamation</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Explorator Maniple – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase, before an ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit Consolidates.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>That unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>It can Consolidate up to 6&quot; if the move ends within range of the Acquisition objective.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-auto-oracular-retrieval" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;disembarked-this-turn&quot;]}" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that disembarked from a TRANSPORT this turn."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Auto-oracular Retrieval</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Explorator Maniple – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army that disembarked from a <button class="term-button" data-term="datasheet-transport" data-term-title="Transport" data-term-summary="Transport capacity 12 ADEPTUS MECHANICUS INFANTRY models.">TRANSPORT</button> this turn.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within range of your Acquisition objective marker, add 1 to the Wound roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-incense-exhausts" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]},{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;,&quot;SMOKE&quot;]}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;within-6&quot;]}" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS INFANTRY unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks, and one friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS SMOKE unit within 6&quot; of it."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Incense Exhausts</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Explorator Maniple – Wargear</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS INFANTRY unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks, and one friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS SMOKE unit within 6&quot; of it.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, both of those units have the <button class="term-button" data-term="core-stealth" data-term-title="STEALTH" data-term-summary="The stealthiest warriors can evade the attentions, and the bullets, of their foes. If every model in a unit has this ability, each time a ranged attack targets that unit, that unit has the benefit of cover against that attack Benefit of Cover." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-33">Stealth</button> ability and the Benefit of Cover.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-reactive-safeguard" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]},{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;TRANSPORT&quot;]}]}" data-target="One eligible ADEPTUS MECHANICUS INFANTRY unit and a friendly TRANSPORT."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Reactive Safeguard</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Explorator Maniple – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Opponent's Charge phase, after a charge is declared.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One eligible ADEPTUS MECHANICUS INFANTRY unit and a friendly <button class="term-button" data-term="datasheet-transport" data-term-title="Transport" data-term-summary="Transport capacity 12 ADEPTUS MECHANICUS INFANTRY models.">TRANSPORT</button>.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>The unit can embark within that <button class="term-button" data-term="datasheet-transport" data-term-title="Transport" data-term-summary="Transport capacity 12 ADEPTUS MECHANICUS INFANTRY models.">TRANSPORT</button> if capacity and distance restrictions are met.</p></article></section></div>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="explorator-maniple-enhancements" data-track="explorator-maniple-enhancements"><h3 class="category-title">Enhancements</h3><div class="detachment-grid"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-artisan" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Artisan"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Artisan</h4><p>While the bearer is leading a unit that is within range of your Acquisition objective marker, once per phase, you can change the result of one Hit roll, one Wound roll or one saving throw made for that unit to an unmodified 6.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-magos" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Magos"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Magos</h4><p>At the end of your Command phase, if the bearer is within range of your Acquisition objective marker, roll one D6: on a 4+, you gain 1CP.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-logis" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Logis"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Logis</h4><p>While the bearer is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack that targets a unit within range of your Acquisition objective marker, add 1 to the Hit roll.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-genetor" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Genetor"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Genetor</h4><p>While the bearer is leading a unit that is within range of your Acquisition objective marker, models in that unit have a 4+ invulnerable save.</p></article></div></section></div>
    </section>
<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="haloscreed-battle-clade">
      <h2>Haloscreed Battle Clade</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="haloscreed-battle-clade-stratagems" data-track="haloscreed-battle-clade-stratagems"><h3 class="category-title">Stratagems</h3><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-eradication-protocols" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Eradication Protocols</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Haloscreed Battle Clade - Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, re-roll Wound rolls of 1; if it is a <button class="term-button" data-term="halo-override" data-term-title="Halo Override" data-term-summary="Temporary keyword granted by Noospheric Transference.">HALO OVERRIDE</button> unit, also re-roll Hit rolls of 1.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-aggressive-impulse" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;units&quot;:[&quot;unit-skorpius-dunerider&quot;]}]}" data-target="One SKORPIUS DUNERIDER model that has not been selected to move this phase."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Aggressive Impulse</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Haloscreed Battle Clade - Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One SKORPIUS DUNERIDER model that has not been selected to move this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the turn, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS units that disembark after that model makes a Normal move remain eligible to declare a charge.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-targeting-override" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Targeting Override</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Haloscreed Battle Clade - Battle Tactic Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-guided-retreat" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="That ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Guided Retreat</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Haloscreed Battle Clade - Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase, just after an ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit Falls Back.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>That ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the turn, it is eligible to shoot and charge after Falling Back. If it is a <button class="term-button" data-term="halo-override" data-term-title="Halo Override" data-term-summary="Temporary keyword granted by Noospheric Transference.">HALO OVERRIDE</button> unit, Desperate Escape tests for it can be re-rolled.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-neural-overload" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Neural Overload</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Haloscreed Battle Clade - Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit from your army.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>If your unit is a <button class="term-button" data-term="halo-override" data-term-title="Halo Override" data-term-summary="Temporary keyword granted by Noospheric Transference.">HALO OVERRIDE</button> unit, it suffers D3 mortal wounds. Select one Override ability; until the start of your next Command phase, that ability is active for your unit. Designer's Note: a unit that already has <button class="term-button" data-term="halo-override" data-term-title="Halo Override" data-term-summary="Temporary keyword granted by Noospheric Transference.">HALO OVERRIDE</button> can have several Override abilities active at once, but suffers the mortal wounds. A unit without <button class="term-button" data-term="halo-override" data-term-title="Halo Override" data-term-summary="Temporary keyword granted by Noospheric Transference.">HALO OVERRIDE</button> gains only the selected Override ability and does not benefit from other active Override abilities.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-analytical-divination" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;KATAPHRON&quot;]}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;within-8-of-trigger&quot;,&quot;unengaged&quot;]}" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS INFANTRY unit, excluding KATAPHRON, within 8&quot; and not within Engagement Range."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Analytical Divination</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Haloscreed Battle Clade - Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent's Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS INFANTRY unit, excluding KATAPHRON, within 8&quot; and not within Engagement Range.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6&quot;, or up to 6&quot; instead if it is a <button class="term-button" data-term="halo-override" data-term-title="Halo Override" data-term-summary="Temporary keyword granted by Noospheric Transference.">HALO OVERRIDE</button> unit.</p></article></section></div>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="haloscreed-battle-clade-enhancements" data-track="haloscreed-battle-clade-enhancements"><h3 class="category-title">Enhancements</h3><div class="detachment-grid"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-transoracular-dyad-wafers" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;units&quot;:[&quot;unit-cybernetica-datasmith&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Transoracular Dyad Wafers"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Transoracular Dyad Wafers</h4><p>CYBERNETICA DATASMITH model only. When attached to KASTELAN ROBOTS, models in that unit gain <button class="term-button" data-term="halo-override" data-term-title="Halo Override" data-term-summary="Temporary keyword granted by Noospheric Transference.">HALO OVERRIDE</button> until the end of the battle. That unit cannot be selected for Noospheric Transference.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-cognitive-reinforcement" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;,&quot;CYBERNETICA DATASMITH&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Cognitive Reinforcement"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Cognitive Reinforcement</h4><p>ADEPTUS MECHANICUS model only, excluding CYBERNETICA DATASMITH. The Conqueror and Protector Imperatives are both active for the bearer's unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-sanctified-ordnance" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Sanctified Ordnance"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Sanctified Ordnance</h4><p>ADEPTUS MECHANICUS model only. Add 6&quot; to the Range of ranged weapons equipped by models in the bearer's unit; <button class="term-button" data-term="core-hazardous" data-term-title="[HAZARDOUS]" data-term-summary="Weapons powered by unstable and dangerous energy sources pose a substantial risk to the wielder and those that stand beside them.…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-15">Hazardous</button> tests for that unit can be re-rolled.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-inloaded-lethality" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;],&quot;units&quot;:[&quot;unit-tech-priest-dominus&quot;,&quot;unit-tech-priest-manipulus&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Inloaded Lethality"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Inloaded Lethality</h4><p>TECH-PRIEST DOMINUS or TECH-PRIEST MANIPULUS model only. Add 3 to the Attacks and 1 to the Damage characteristics of the bearer's melee weapons.</p></article></div></section></div>
    </section>
<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="rad-zone-corps">
      <h2>Rad-zone Corps</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="rad-zone-corps-stratagems" data-track="rad-zone-corps-stratagems"><h3 class="category-title">Stratagems</h3><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-extinction-order" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;TECH-PRIEST&quot;]},{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;objective&quot;}]}" data-target="One TECH-PRIEST and one objective within 24&quot;."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Extinction Order</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-zone Corps – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Command phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One TECH-PRIEST and one objective within 24&quot;.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Roll for enemy units on that objective; on a 4+ they suffer 1 mortal wound and take a Battle-shock test.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-lethal-dosage" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit that has not shot."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Lethal Dosage</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-zone Corps – Wargear</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit that has not shot.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Its ranged weapons gain <button class="term-button" data-term="core-lethal-hits" data-term-title="[LETHAL HITS]" data-term-summary="When an attack with LETHAL HITS scores a Critical Hit, it automatically wounds. No Wound roll is made, so that attack cannot score a Critical Wound." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-23">[LETHAL HITS]</button> for the phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-pre-calibrated-purge-solution" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;]}]}" data-target="One eligible ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit, with a BATTLELINE relay option."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Pre-calibrated Purge Solution</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-zone Corps – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One eligible ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit, with a BATTLELINE relay option.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Re-roll Hit rolls for ranged attacks targeting units within the opponent's deployment zone.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-aggressor-imperative" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SKITARII&quot;]}]}" data-target="One eligible SKITARII unit, with a BATTLELINE relay option."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Aggressor Imperative</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-zone Corps – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One eligible SKITARII unit, with a BATTLELINE relay option.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>When the targeted units Advance, add 6&quot; to Move instead of rolling.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-bulwark-imperative" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SKITARII&quot;]}]}" data-target="One targeted SKITARII unit, with a BATTLELINE relay option."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Bulwark Imperative</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-zone Corps – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Opponent's Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One targeted SKITARII unit, with a BATTLELINE relay option.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Models in the targeted units have a 4+ invulnerable save for the phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-baleful-halo" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;VEHICLE&quot;]}]}" data-target="One non-VEHICLE ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit, with a BATTLELINE relay option."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Baleful Halo</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Rad-zone Corps – Battle Tactic</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase, after an enemy selects targets.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One non-VEHICLE ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit, with a BATTLELINE relay option.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Subtract 1 from Wound rolls for attacks targeting the selected units until end of turn.</p></article></section></div>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="rad-zone-corps-enhancements" data-track="rad-zone-corps-enhancements"><h3 class="category-title">Enhancements</h3><div class="detachment-grid"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-autoclavic-denunciation" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Autoclavic Denunciation"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Autoclavic Denunciation</h4><p>Ranged weapons equipped by the bearer have the <button class="term-button" data-term="core-anti-infantry" data-term-title="Anti-Infantry" data-term-summary="Unmodified successful Wound rolls at the listed value score Critical Wounds against INFANTRY units.">[ANTI-INFANTRY 2+</button>] and [ANTI-MONSTER 4+] abilities.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-malphonic-susurrus" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Malphonic Susurrus"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Malphonic Susurrus</h4><p>While the bearer is leading a unit, models in that unit have the <button class="term-button" data-term="core-stealth" data-term-title="STEALTH" data-term-summary="The stealthiest warriors can evade the attentions, and the bullets, of their foes. If every model in a unit has this ability, each time a ranged attack targets that unit, that unit has the benefit of cover against that attack Benefit of Cover." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-33">Stealth</button> ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-peerless-eradicator" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Peerless Eradicator"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Peerless Eradicator</h4><p>While the bearer is leading a unit, ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the <button class="term-button" data-term="core-sustained-hits" data-term-title="[SUSTAINED HITS]" data-term-summary="Some weapons possess a punishing rate of fire, or can land devastating flurries of blows, tearing the foe apart with relentless ferocity. This ability always takes the form [SUSTAINED HITS X].…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-36">[SUSTAINED HITS</button> 1] ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-radial-suffusion" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;ADEPTUS MECHANICUS&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Radial Suffusion"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Radial Suffusion</h4><p>From the second battle round onwards, when resolving the Fallout effect of the Rad-bombardment Detachment rule, if the bearer is on the battlefield, roll one D6 for each enemy unit within 6&quot; of your opponent’s deployment zone, in addition to those that are within your opponent’s deployment zone.</p></article></div></section></div>
    </section>
<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="skitarii-hunter-cohort">
      <h2>Skitarii Hunter Cohort</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="skitarii-hunter-cohort-stratagems" data-track="skitarii-hunter-cohort-stratagems"><h3 class="category-title">Stratagems</h3><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-binharic-offence" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;count&quot;:2,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SKITARII&quot;]},{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;enemy&quot;}]}" data-target="Two SKITARII units and one enemy unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Binharic Offence</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Skitarii Hunter Cohort – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Start of your Shooting or Fight phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>Two SKITARII units and one enemy unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Improve AP by 1 for both units, but they can only target the selected enemy unit for the phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-shroud-protocols" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SKITARII&quot;,&quot;INFANTRY&quot;]}]}" data-target="One targeted SKITARII INFANTRY unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Shroud Protocols</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Skitarii Hunter Cohort – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Opponent's Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One targeted SKITARII INFANTRY unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>The unit can only be targeted by ranged attacks from models within 18&quot; for the phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-isolate-and-destroy" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;SICARIAN&quot;,&quot;PTERAXII&quot;,&quot;SYDONIAN&quot;,&quot;IRONSTRIDER BALLISTARII&quot;,&quot;MOUNTED&quot;]}]}" data-target="One SICARIAN, PTERAXII, SYDONIAN, IRONSTRIDER BALLISTARII or SKITARII MOUNTED unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Isolate and Destroy</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Skitarii Hunter Cohort – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One SICARIAN, PTERAXII, SYDONIAN, IRONSTRIDER BALLISTARII or SKITARII MOUNTED unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, if there are no other enemy units within 6&quot; of the unit targeted by that attack, add 1 to the Wound roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-yours" data-rule-id="stratagem-expedited-purge-protocol" data-turn="YOUR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SKITARII&quot;]}]}" data-target="One SKITARII unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Expedited Purge Protocol</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Skitarii Hunter Cohort – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Charge phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One SKITARII unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>The unit can declare a charge after Advancing.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-programmed-withdrawal" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;count&quot;:2,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SICARIAN&quot;]},{&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;SKITARII&quot;],&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;INFANTRY&quot;,&quot;MOUNTED&quot;]}]}" data-target="Up to two SICARIAN units, or one SKITARII INFANTRY or MOUNTED unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Programmed Withdrawal</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Skitarii Hunter Cohort – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>End of opponent's Fight phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>Up to two SICARIAN units, or one SKITARII INFANTRY or MOUNTED unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Remove eligible unengaged units and place them into Strategic Reserves.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface turn-their" data-rule-id="stratagem-bionic-endurance" data-turn="THEIR TURN" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;any&quot;:[&quot;SICARIAN&quot;,&quot;PTERAXII&quot;,&quot;SYDONIAN&quot;]}]}" data-target="One targeted SICARIAN, PTERAXII or SYDONIAN unit."><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>Bionic Endurance</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Skitarii Hunter Cohort – Strategic Ploy</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, after an enemy selects targets.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One targeted SICARIAN, PTERAXII or SYDONIAN unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Models in the unit have <button class="term-button" data-term="core-feel-no-pain" data-term-title="FEEL NO PAIN" data-term-summary="The hardiest warriors refuse to be laid low, even by wounds that should by all rights prove lethal. This ability always takes the form Feel No Pain X+. Each time a model with this ability would lose a wound, roll one D6: on an X+, that wound is not lost." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-12">Feel No Pain 5+</button> for the phase.</p></article></section></div>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="skitarii-hunter-cohort-enhancements" data-track="skitarii-hunter-cohort-enhancements"><h3 class="category-title">Enhancements</h3><div class="detachment-grid"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-veiled-hunter" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;units&quot;:[&quot;unit-skitarii-marshal&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Veiled Hunter"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Veiled Hunter</h4><p>After both players have deployed their armies, you can select up to three SKITARII INFANTRY units from your army and redeploy all of those units. When doing so, any of those units can be placed into Strategic Reserves, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-clandestine-infiltrator" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;SKITARII&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Clandestine Infiltrator"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Clandestine Infiltrator</h4><p>The bearer, and models in any unit they are leading, have the <button class="term-button" data-term="core-infiltrators" data-term-title="INFILTRATORS" data-term-summary="Many armies employ reconnaissance units who can sit concealed, waiting for the right moment to strike. During deployment, if every model in a unit has this ability, it can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 8&quot; horizontally from your opponent’s deployment…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-20">Infiltrators</button> and <button class="term-button" data-term="datasheet-scouts-6" data-term-title="SCOUTS" data-term-summary="Scouts form the vanguard of many armies. Unnoticed by the enemy, they range ahead of the main force. This ability always takes the form Scouts X&quot;. In the Resolve Pre-battle Abilities step, if every model in a unit has this ability, you can do one of the following:…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-31">Scouts 6&quot;</button> abilities.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-cantic-thrallnet" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;units&quot;:[&quot;unit-skitarii-marshal&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Cantic Thrallnet"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Cantic Thrallnet</h4><p>At the start of the battle round, you can select one friendly SKITARII unit within 12&quot; of the bearer. Until the start of the next battle round, the Protector Imperative and the Conqueror Imperative are both active for that unit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-battle-sphere-uplink" data-eligibility="{&quot;targets&quot;:[{&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;all&quot;:[&quot;CHARACTER&quot;,&quot;SKITARII&quot;],&quot;none&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}]}" data-enhancement-title="Battle-Sphere Uplink"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4>Battle-Sphere Uplink</h4><p>In your Shooting phase, after the bearer’s unit has shot, if it is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, that unit can make a Normal move of up to 6&quot;. If it does, until the end of the turn, that unit is not eligible to declare a charge.</p></article></div></section></div>
